# Nothing under these paths is a source of truth. Every one of them is produced
# by a tool from something else in this repository, and a benchmark repository
# that commits them stops being cheap to clone thirty-two times over.

# --- Python bytecode --------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- KiCad local scratch ----------------------------------------------------
*-backups/
fp-info-cache
*.lck
*~
.#*
*.bak
*.tmp
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.kicad_sch-bak

# --- Toolkit run output -----------------------------------------------------
# `run.py validate|release|selftest` owns one attempt directory per invocation
# and writes nothing outside it. The verdict JSON is the evidence; the work
# tree that produced it is not.
out/
build/
verification/out/

# --- Placement and routing search scratch -----------------------------------
# A candidate is a comparison artefact until a human promotes it. An unpromoted
# pool is deleted, not committed; a promoted one is moved somewhere it is named
# and explained.
candidates/*
!candidates/README.md
benchmark/**/workdir_*/
benchmark/**/candidates/
*.kicad_pcb.pre-*

# --- Field-solver scratch ---------------------------------------------------
# openEMS writes field dumps and mesh data measured in hundreds of megabytes.
# Keep the extracted result; never the run that produced it.
openems/
*.h5
*.vtk
*.vtr
*.vtu

# --- Logs -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
